    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense, but some people online and even some scientists argue that biological sex is the only objective reality and that gender identity is just a social construct or even a psychological thing rather than something \"scientific.\" How does the consensus address those arguments? Are those views considered scientifically invalid?",
